{"id":"aefe2f591e1b3f6f8c3e6a0b97ba7fc58f8d5cab","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"aefe2f591e1b3f6f8c3e6a0b97ba7fc58f8d5cab","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/pnpr-serve-unlisted-upstream-versions.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+\"@pnpm/pnpr\": patch","+---","+","+pnpr now serves a version published upstream after it cached the package's packument. A request for a version, its tarball, or its manifest that the cached packument does not list refetches the packument, at most once a minute per package. Before, pnpr answered `404` until `packumentTtl` expired [#18180](https://github.com/pnpm/pnpm/issues/18180)."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpr/crates/pnpr/src/server.rs","lines":["@@ -103,8 +103,9 @@ use upstream_tarballs::{"," mod upstream_integrity;"," mod upstream_packuments;"," use upstream_packuments::{","-    load_packument_for_read, load_upstream_packument, read_source_packument,","-    recover_stale_upstream_packument, serve_packument_via_upstream,","+    PackumentRefetches, load_packument_for_read, load_upstream_packument, read_source_packument,","+    recover_stale_upstream_packument, reload_source_packument_lacking_version,","+    reload_upstream_packument_lacking_version, serve_packument_via_upstream,"," };"," "," mod request_access;"],"additions":3,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpr/crates/pnpr/src/server/package_reads.rs","lines":["@@ -6,8 +6,9 @@ use super::{","     dist_view, ensure_osv_allowed, extract_upstream_version_manifest, extract_version_manifest,","     is_osv_vulnerable_packument_version, is_tar_registry, not_found,","     package_responses::processing::admission::DocumentSource, packument_response,","-    read_source_packument, registry_endpoint, resolve_version_or_tag, serve_packument_via_upstream,","-    serve_tarball_via_upstream, tar_integrities_of, tarball_response,","+    read_source_packument, registry_endpoint, reload_source_packument_lacking_version,","+    resolve_version_